direction: right
Merchant: Merchant {shape: person}
PaymentAPI: Payment API {shape: rectangle}
Saga: Settlement saga {shape: hexagon}
Risk: Risk service {shape: rectangle}
Ledger: Ledger service {shape: rectangle}
Bank: Banking network {shape: cloud}
Balance: Merchant balance {shape: cylinder}
Events: Settlement events {shape: queue}
Reconcile: Reconciliation worker {shape: rectangle}
Merchant -> PaymentAPI: capture payment
PaymentAPI -> Saga
Saga -> Risk: screen transaction
Risk -> Saga: approved
Saga -> Ledger: reserve funds
Ledger -> Saga: reservation posted
Saga -> Bank: submit settlement
Bank -> Saga: settlement accepted
Saga -> Balance: credit merchant
Saga -> Events: SettlementCompleted
Events -> Reconcile
Risk -> Saga: rejected
Saga -> Ledger: reverse reservation
Bank -> Saga: settlement rejected
Saga -> Events: SettlementFailed
Reconcile -> Ledger: repair discrepancy
